{{#> base}}
<h2>Welcome aboard, {{username}} — your free trial is live</h2>
<p>You're all set. Your <strong>{{planName}}</strong> trial is active until <strong>{{endedAt}}</strong>, with no charges and no card on file.</p>
<p>While the trial is running you have the same access as a paying member — explore the dashboard, set up your watchlist, and take it for a spin.</p>
<p style="text-align:center;">
  <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="btn">Open your dashboard</a>
</p>
<p>Want to keep going after the trial ends? You can upgrade to a paid plan from your account at any time — no need to wait until the last day.</p>
<p>Questions? Just reply to this email and a human will get back to you.</p>
{{/base}}
